{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And he shall cut it into parts.</b> Lest you say concerning cattle, since it is a large animal, it requires cutting into parts, but a small animal does not — therefore it is stated. But for flaying, no verse is needed, for it is obvious to us that it requires flaying like the large one."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:35.211929440Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}